**Make the code more elegant** 

```go
if form.MediaId > 0 {
	query.Where("media_id = ?", form.MediaId)
}
```
to 

```go
query.When(form.MediaId > 0, func(query *bun.SelectQuery) {
   query.Where("media_id = ?", form.MediaId);
})
```

